APIRequest has model which has the data that should be sent , apiurlkey which the endpoint we send only the key and parameters

with the help of Hepler class we get the details from the config file we combine the endpoint and the parameters

In background 

client is created with baseurl, headers, auth

request is sent specifying the method and the endpoint url that we got with parameters

request content is assigned to the model that we send via APIRequest 

the request is made and we get the response we deserialize the response
